C963 8604             (adybug/src/main.s):01689                 lda     #$04            ; data-register access
C965 B7FF21           (adybug/src/main.s):01690                 sta     PIA2_CRA
C968 7FFF23           (adybug/src/main.s):01691                 clr     PIA2_CRB
